Cassotis modifications, September 2026:
Fine-tuned an offline correction teacher on independent real IME drafts, then
initialized and distilled a six-layer student with a restricted character
vocabulary, pinyin-constrained output, and separately cacheable document
attention. Exported and quantized the context and query graphs to INT8 ONNX.
The original teacher and training documents are not distributed in the IME.
